# Generated, and source here: the engine's bundled Tide catalog and the
# highlighting artifacts, which `generated/` above would hide (and keep out of
# the sdist, whose build compiles them in), and their copies in a crate's assets/
# (`scripts/engine/release.py vendor`), which `cargo package` would leave out.
!/data/catalogs/tide/generated/
!/highlights/generated/
!/crates/*/assets/data/catalogs/tide/generated/
!/crates/*/assets/highlights/generated/
